ou make. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/c0a3bd137c71e7453ffbb1d1a1e03f6f.poster.avif?t=1752333518\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/c0a3bd137c71e7453ffbb1d1a1e03f6f.webm?t=1752333518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/c0a3bd137c71e7453ffbb1d1a1e03f6f.mp4?t=1752333518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quality matters - each time you deliver an order, you will get a rating from the customer. They're quite picky - to get the perfect S rank, you'll need to become one with your firearms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/134738594c836b4be61a7b0a27d08d12.poster.avif?t=1752333518\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/134738594c836b4be61a7b0a27d08d12.webm?t=1752333518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/134738594c836b4be61a7b0a27d08d12.mp4?t=1752333518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the shift, all your mistakes will be added together. If the customers at the end of the day aren't happy with your performance, you will be fired! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/a2e879da8f1bc708da1c0b43652b8dc4.poster.avif?t=1752333518\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/a2e879da8f1bc708da1c0b43652b8dc4.webm?t=1752333518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/a2e879da8f1bc708da1c0b43652b8dc4.mp4?t=1752333518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
